      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "To develop expressions for variances and covariances of linear combinations of random variables, we must first introduce the concept of quadratic forms. Consider an $ n \\times n $ square matrix A and an $ n \\times 1 $ column vector x. From the rules of matrix multiplication,",
